cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this data package and the associated manuscript when using these data or plotting scripts."
type: dataset
url: "https://github.com/Peter-mark27/cspbi3-strain-vacancy"
title: "Data and plotting code for Multiphysics Modeling Reveals Strain-Gradient-Induced Iodide-Vacancy Accumulation in CsPbI3 Perovskite"
authors:
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Jun-Jie"
  - family-names: "Cui"
    given-names: "Chuan-Xin"
  - family-names: "Jiang"
    given-names: "Jin-Wu"
abstract: >-
  Processed numerical data, reference figures, and plotting scripts for
  strain-gradient-induced iodide-vacancy redistribution in CsPbI3 perovskite.
  The data include atomistic calibration points, convergence summaries,
  baseline concentration and electrostatic fields, flux competition,
  parameter scans, and analytical comparisons.
keywords:
  - CsPbI3
  - iodide vacancy
  - strain gradient
  - vacancy transport
  - electrostatics
  - multiphysics modeling
